msgid "Default browser"
msgstr "Privzeti brskalnik"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Other command…"
msgstr "Drug ukaz …"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Command"
msgstr "Ukaz"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Google account"
msgstr "Račun Google"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml ../contents/ui/config/ConfigViews.qml
msgid "Default"
msgstr "Ponastavi"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Join buttons open Google Meet links there; other meeting links open in the "
"default browser. In a command, %u stands for the meeting link. Google "
"account: its number (0, 1, …) or email, as in Google's account switcher; "
"empty uses the app's default."
msgstr ""
"Gumbi Pridruži se tam odprejo povezave Google Meet; druge povezave do "
"sestankov se odprejo v privzetem brskalniku. V ukazu %u pomeni povezavo do "
"sestanka. Račun Google: njegova številka (0, 1, …) ali e-pošta, kot v "
"Googlovem preklopniku računov; prazno uporabi privzeto vrednost programa."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Meetings"
msgstr "Sestanki"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Open the meeting link when a meeting starts"
msgstr "Ob začetku sestanka odpri povezavo do sestanka"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "For meetings you accepted or organize, not marked as ended."
msgstr ""
"Za sestanke, ki ste jih sprejeli ali jih organizirate in niso označeni kot "
"končani."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Pause music and videos when joining a meeting"
msgstr "Ustavi glasbo in videe ob pridružitvi sestanku"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid ""
"Players that are playing (eg: Spotify, Elisa, a video in the browser), when "
"a Join button opens a meeting or it opens when the meeting starts."
msgstr ""
"Predvajalniki, ki predvajajo (npr. Spotify, Elisa, video v brskalniku), ko "
"gumb Pridruži odpre sestanek ali se ta odpre ob začetku."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Do Not Disturb during meetings"
msgstr "Ne moti med sestanki"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid ""
"Plasma's Do Not Disturb from the start until the end of a meeting with "
"guests or a meeting link. Mark as Ended turns it off."
msgstr ""
"Način Ne moti v Plasmi od začetka do konca sestanka z gosti ali s povezavo "
"do sestanka. Označi kot končano ga izklopi."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Only meetings I accepted"
msgstr "Samo sestanki, ki sem jih sprejel"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Invitations"
msgstr "Povabila"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "New invitations for today"
msgstr "Nova povabila za danes"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid ""
"A notification for each meeting today you haven't answered yet, with Yes, "
"Maybe and No."
msgstr ""
"Obvestilo za vsak današnji sestanek, na katerega še niste odgovorili, z "
"možnostmi Da, Morda in Ne."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Daily Agenda"
msgstr "Dnevni red za danes"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Today's events every morning"
msgstr "Današnji dogodki vsako jutro"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid ""
"A notification with today's events once a day, also when the computer is "
"turned on later."
msgstr ""
"Obvestilo z današnjimi dogodki enkrat na dan, tudi če računalnik vklopite "
"pozneje."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "At"
msgstr "Ob"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "All Event Notifications"
msgstr "Vsa obvestila o dogodkih"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "\"Join meeting\" button"
msgstr "Gumb »Pridruži se sestanku«"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "In the notification when a meeting starts."
msgstr "V obvestilu, ko se sestanek začne."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Skip all-day events"
msgstr "Preskoči celodnevne dogodke"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Skip events I declined"
msgstr "Preskoči dogodke, ki sem jih zavrnil"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid ""
"Popups and sounds for each kind of notification can also be set in System "
"Settings > Notifications > Event Calendar."
msgstr ""
"Pojavna okna in zvoke za vsako vrsto obvestil lahko nastavite tudi v "
"Sistemske nastavitve > Obvestila > Event Calendar."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Google Account"
msgstr "Googlov račun"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigTasks.qml
msgid "Google Account %1"
msgstr "Googlov račun %1"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Login failed: %1"
msgstr "Prijava ni uspela: %1"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Login complete."
msgstr "Prijava je končana."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Could not prepare Google login: %1"
msgstr "Ni bilo mogoče pripraviti prijave v Google: %1"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Waiting for browser callback..."
msgstr "Čakanje na odziv brskalnika..."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Sign-in timed out. Try again."
msgstr "Čas za prijavo je potekel. Poskusite znova."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Auto login failed. See logs for details."
msgstr "Samodejna prijava ni uspela. Podrobnosti so v dnevnikih."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Auto login failed: invalid callback data."
msgstr "Samodejna prijava ni uspela: neveljavni podatki odziva."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Auto login failed: %1"
msgstr "Samodejna prijava ni uspela: %1"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Auto login failed: authorization code missing."
msgstr "Samodejna prijava ni uspela: manjka avtorizacijska koda."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid ""
"The desktop could not open the browser automatically. Use the login link in "
"Advanced sign-in options instead."
msgstr ""
"Namizje ni moglo samodejno odpreti brskalnika. Namesto tega uporabite "
"povezavo za prijavo v naprednih možnostih prijave."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid ""
"Sign in to show your Google calendars and task lists. Your browser opens to "
"sign in; when access is granted the widget picks it up automatically."
msgstr ""
"Prijavite se, da bodo prikazani vaši Googlovi koledarji in seznami opravil. "
"Za prijavo se odpre brskalnik; ko je dostop odobren, ga gradnik samodejno "
"prevzame."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Sign In Again"
msgstr "Ponovno se prijavi"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Reload calendars and task lists"
msgstr "Znova naloži koledarje in sezname opravil"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigTasks.qml
msgid "Remove Account"
msgstr "Odstrani račun"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigTasks.qml
msgid "Remove"
msgstr "Odstrani"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid ""
"Google access for this account expired or was revoked. Sign in again to "
"reconnect it (the account and its settings are kept)."
msgstr ""
"Dostop do Googla za ta račun je potekel ali je bil preklican. Ponovno se "
"prijavite, da ga znova povežete (račun in njegove nastavitve se ohranijo)."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "The widget was updated. Sign in again to keep this account in sync."
msgstr ""
"Gradnik je bil posodobljen. Ponovno se prijavite, da bo ta račun ostal "
"usklajen."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "No calendars loaded yet. Use the reload button."
msgstr "Koledarji še niso naloženi. Uporabite gumb za ponovno nalaganje."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Task lists are chosen on the Tasks page."
msgstr "Sezname opravil izberete na strani Opravila."

